| `good_notebooks/calibration/fit_absorption_field.ipynb` | `1b206d16` | the calibration notebook that drives the fit |

## Caveat

Unmerged research in both versions. The student copy duplicates library code it could have imported,
which is what makes it standalone and also what makes it stale; the twin is the version to read if
you are deciding whether this capability belongs in the tree.
